1
00:00:02,507 --> 00:00:13,327
In Authentik Directory -> Users, create an operator account with an email address and add it to oscar-operators, oscar-admins, or oscar-viewers.

2
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:15,833
Click Create recovery link on the user Overview tab to generate a single-use 1-tap SSO Passkey enrollment URL.

3
00:00:15,873 --> 00:00:21,714
To offboard a user completely, delete the account in Authentik; oscar-hub-sync automatically revokes Octelium access, then delete any cached /users row.
